Z||000000||firstfiero||08-31-2001||12:00 PM|||| <A HREF="http://board.mr2pages.com/showthread.php?s=5cf9101e92a94d1640d63a5c31676704&threadid=38289" TARGET=_blank>http://board.mr2pages.com/showthread.php?s=5cf9101e92a94d1640d63a5c31676704&threadid=38289</A> <P>Well I posted...didn't flame at all....Sorry can't stand to have someone saying that base 1st gen. mr2's are faster. When I know from the numbers in the book I have that it's absolutly not true! Anyway if your going to post don't flame....let's keep the level of intelligent conversation up.<P>------------------<BR><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||My7Fieros||08-31-2001||10:04 PM||||Well, it'll never end. People who are fans or owners of diff cars have always argued whos is better and faster. With the introduction of the internet a few years ago, its just gotten easier to do. I didnt reply, dont need to. They can be proud of their MR2's if they want to...let 'em brag. I personally think first gen MR2's are the ugliest car ever produced. Amazing how something so similar to the notchback fiero can be so ugly. It just looks so "Japanese typical"...ya know?<BR>Now the newer MR2's (I dont know sh1t about MR2's)..the ones that copied the fastback Fiero, looks nice...but, Im just not into Japanese cars (sports cars anyway).<BR>Have you ever looked under the hood at most any Japanese car's engine?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> You think the V6 Fiero engine is complex...forget about it! Nothing but wires, vaccuum lines, and all sorts of strange sh1t under the hood of an MR2 or any Jap ride...no thanx.<BR>Anyway, I'll stick w/ my little plastic headache, I love em!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||1
