Z||000004||FieroKyle||09-01-2001||03:17 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Songman:<BR><B>I don't even look over there... I don't own an MR2 so figure I have no business over there.. let them believe what they want and we will too...<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>But theres a difference of having a big head and a head with the facts. If they want to jump on the Fieros are P.O.S.'s we have force (of 3000 members strong) to go straighten them out and let out the facts, then step back and see what foolish thing they say next.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000005||Galen||09-01-2001||04:40 PM||||Think about it this way, who gives a rats ass if they have their facts straight or not. I personally could careless. Going over there attempting to 'set their facts straight' using 'force' is childish behaviour and is something I'd not expect out of members of this forum. But hey, if you wanna be childish, go right ahead. If you wanna make the mr2 community think less of us than they already do, then by all means, Degrade us. <P>This as well was recently done with the probe board, whereas I dislike probes, I did not and still do not see the meaning or any valid purpose behind going to <B>their</B> board and trashing <B>their</B> cars. <P>On a similar note, I've found that the folks over at thirdgen.org have been rather friendly toward fiero related material and information. Seeing as how many of their v6 fbodied cars are in fact sharing similar engines and can be made to do similar things, performance wise. <P>Now let me apologize for for my b52 style ranting, and I will get down off my p<B>ed</B>istol and be happy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Thank you<P><FONT SIZE="1">yes I am</FONT><P>------------------<BR>Ray -  <A HREF="mailto:galen@ezrpg.com">galen@ezrpg.com</A>  - <A HREF="http://www.fierolinks.f2s.com/" TARGET=_blank><B>Fierolinks!</B></A><BR><FONT COLOR="purple">1988 Hawaiin Orchid Coupe</FONT> - <FONT SIZE="1">under construction</FONT><BR><LI> AIM<B>:</B> Fiero88cpe<FONT SIZE="1"><BR><LI> ICQ<B>:</B> 98668558</FONT>||||reg||1
